[{"text":"FCLoopScalelessQ[int, {p1, p2, ...}] checks whether the loop integral int depending on the loop momenta p1, p2, ... is scaleless. Only integrals that admit a Feynman parametrization with proper \\(U\\) and \\(F\\) polynomials are supported.","anchor":"fcloopscalelessq"},{"text":"The function uses the algorithm of Alexey Pak arXiv:1111.0868. Cf. also the PhD thesis of Jens Hoff 10.5445/IR/1000047447 for the detailed description of a possible implementation.","anchor":"fcloopscalelessq"},{"text":"Overview, FCTopology, GLI, FCLoopToPakForm, FCLoopPakOrder, FCLoopScalelessQ.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"A scaleless 2-loop tadpole","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopScalelessQ[FAD[p1, p2, p1 - p2], {p1, p2}]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{True}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"A 1-loop massless eikonal integral.","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopScalelessQ[SFAD[{{0, 2 p . q}, 0}, p], {p}]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{True}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"A 1-loop massive eikonal integral.","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopScalelessQ[SFAD[{{0, 2 p . q}, 0}, p], {p}]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{True}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"A scaleless topology","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCTopology[topo, {SFAD[{{I p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{I p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{0, -2 p1 . q}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{I p3 + I q, 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{0, p1 . p3}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p3}, {q}, {}, {}] FCLoopScalelessQ[%]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(-\\text{p3}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(-\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(-2 (\\text{p1}\\cdot q)+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((i \\;\\text{p3}+i q)^2+\\text{mb}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}\\cdot \\;\\text{p3}+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p3}\\},\\{q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb4-5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{True}\\]","anchor":"cb4-5","section":"Examples"}]